#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:2
msgid "Link previews"
msgstr "链接预览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:4
msgid ""
"Link previews allows you to see the content of the link you are about to "
"click when you hover over it. This gives you the ability to quickly preview "
"where a link points, so you can keep your context while reading but learn "
"more from other resources."
msgstr "链接预览让你在鼠标悬停于链接时，即可看到即将点击链接的内容。这让你能快速预览链接指向何处，在阅读时保持上下文，同时从其他资源获取更多信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:11
msgid "Example of link previews addon"
msgstr "链接预览 addon 示例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:13
msgid ""
"Link previews will only be generated for internal links--links that point to"
" pages within your documentation site. No link previews will be generated "
"for links to external sites or links that appear outside of the primary "
"content of the documentation page (eg. nav bars)."
msgstr "链接预览仅为内部链接生成——即指向文档站内部页面的链接。指向外部站点的链接，或出现在文档页面主要内容之外（如导航栏）的链接，不会生成预览。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:16
msgid ""
"You can see an example of a link preview by hovering over the following "
"link: :doc:`Addons </addons>`."
msgstr "将鼠标悬停在以下链接上即可查看链接预览示例：:doc:`Addons </addons>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:19
msgid "Enabling link previews"
msgstr "启用链接预览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:21
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Link previews`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Link previews` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:22
msgid "Check :guilabel:`Enabled`."
msgstr "勾选 :guilabel:`Enabled` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:23
msgid "Save your settings -- a rebuild of your project isn't required!"
msgstr "保存设置——无需重新构建项目！"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:26
msgid "Troubleshooting link previews"
msgstr "链接预览故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:28
msgid ""
"We perform some heuristic to detect the documentation tool used to generate "
"the page based on its HTML structure. This auto-detection may fail, "
"resulting in the content rendered inside the popup being incorrect. If you "
"are experiencing this, you can specify the :guilabel:`CSS main content "
"selector` in your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> "
"Advanced`. See :ref:`reference/main-content-detection:detection logic` for "
"how this content is detected and guidance on choosing a good selector. You "
"can also `open an issue in the addons repository "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/addons>`_ so we improve our heuristic."
msgstr ""
"我们基于 HTML 结构用启发式方法检测生成页面的文档工具。该自动检测可能失败，导致弹窗内渲染的内容不正确。如果遇到此问题，可在项目的 "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Advanced` 中指定 :guilabel:`CSS main "
"content selector` 。内容检测原理及选择器建议见 :ref:`reference/main-content-"
"detection:detection logic` 。你也可以 `在 addons 仓库中提交 issue "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/addons>`_ 以帮助我们改进启发式方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/link-previews.rst:34
msgid ""
"Link previews won't be generated if JavaScript is not enabled in your web "
"browser or if all cookies are blocked."
msgstr "若浏览器未启用 JavaScript 或所有 cookie 被拦截，链接预览不会生成。"

